Third-party work in mdl_web
===========================

The web UI's design, its view model (static/view.js), the drawing it
follows (static/app.js, static/app.css), the agent commands in agents.py
and the logos static/qwen.svg, static/lfm.svg and static/hf.svg come from
omarchy-local-ai by 0xSero, https://github.com/0xSero/omarchy-local-ai,
under the MIT license below. The logos are the marks of Qwen, Liquid AI
and Hugging Face, drawn to name their models' makers.

static/mono.woff2 is JetBrainsMono Nerd Font Regular (Nerd Fonts
v3.5.1, https://www.nerdfonts.com), the font the panel draws in, cut down
to the characters and icons the page uses. The font is JetBrains Mono,
under the SIL Open Font License 1.1 below. The icons in it are from
Material Design Icons by Pictogrammers, https://pictogrammers.com, under
the Pictogrammers Free License (the icons under Apache 2.0), below.

